1
00:00:49,470 --> 00:00:52,070
Who do you think you are?

2
00:00:53,630 --> 00:00:55,890
Do you think you deserve to drink with me?

3
00:00:57,750 --> 00:00:59,210
You're not talking again.

4
00:00:59,950 --> 00:01:01,950
I hate it when you act like this.

5
00:01:03,310 --> 00:01:05,040
What are you so arrogant about?

6
00:01:06,440 --> 00:01:07,640
What do you want to do?

7
00:01:08,190 --> 00:01:09,110
Killing you

8
00:01:09,710 --> 00:01:11,570
was my mission in the first place.

9
00:01:11,650 --> 00:01:12,570
Did you forget?

10
00:01:20,310 --> 00:01:22,990
You two put on a really good show.

11
00:01:23,250 --> 00:01:25,610
Too bad. It was just
a hair's breadth away.

12
00:01:26,030 --> 00:01:27,630
Just like that crate—

13
00:01:27,630 --> 00:01:29,430
you saw something you shouldn't have,

14
00:01:29,430 --> 00:01:32,150
and you put it back exactly as it was.

15
00:01:32,310 --> 00:01:35,240
If we hadn't put special numbers
on the wine bottles,

16
00:01:35,690 --> 00:01:38,670
I'm afraid you two would have fooled us.

17
00:01:40,910 --> 00:01:42,640
We really didn't see anything.

18
00:01:42,900 --> 00:01:43,930
Sorry.

19
00:01:44,630 --> 00:01:47,750
Mr. William only trusts dead men.

20
00:01:48,340 --> 00:01:49,190
Men!

21
00:01:51,740 --> 00:01:54,259
[Eclipse in the Lost City] [Episode 11]

22
00:01:57,870 --> 00:01:58,789
Officer Shen,

23
00:01:58,789 --> 00:02:00,280
you should be able to handle
this many people, right?

24
00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:01,560
Let go of me first.

25
00:02:02,030 --> 00:02:02,750
Do it.

26
00:02:21,750 --> 00:02:23,680
What are you waiting for? Let's go!

27
00:02:32,970 --> 00:02:33,510
After them!

28
00:02:33,510 --> 00:02:34,150
Hurry!

29
00:02:42,150 --> 00:02:43,410
There's a window here.

30
00:02:44,280 --> 00:02:45,910
Are you crazy? It's too high to jump.

31
00:02:45,910 --> 00:02:47,110
They ran to the study!

32
00:02:47,130 --> 00:02:47,610
Hurry!

33
00:02:47,640 --> 00:02:48,880
We have no way out.

34
00:03:00,070 --> 00:03:01,470
They escaped through the back window.

35
00:03:01,470 --> 00:03:02,550
After them to the backyard.

36
00:03:02,550 --> 00:03:04,350
Don't let them leave here alive.

37
00:03:04,630 --> 00:03:05,310
-Yes!
-Yes!

38
00:03:19,780 --> 00:03:21,550
There really is a secret passage.

39
00:03:21,550 --> 00:03:22,350
Wait a minute.

40
00:03:23,250 --> 00:03:24,050
What's wrong?

41
00:03:37,730 --> 00:03:39,870
I'm afraid the foreigners
have occupied this house for so long

42
00:03:39,870 --> 00:03:43,670
without knowing there's such
an unusually devised secret passage.

43
00:03:47,510 --> 00:03:48,470
Are you okay?

44
00:03:49,310 --> 00:03:50,870
Couldn't be better.

45
00:03:53,270 --> 00:03:54,070
Shen Tianbai,

46
00:03:54,829 --> 00:03:55,790
I might die.

47
00:03:56,990 --> 00:03:58,070
Before I die,

48
00:03:59,310 --> 00:04:01,040
can I ask you one last question?

49
00:04:02,590 --> 00:04:03,390
What?

50
00:04:03,710 --> 00:04:06,510
Is it the Shisha Gang
who wants to kill me,

51
00:04:08,470 --> 00:04:09,430
or you?

52
00:04:27,630 --> 00:04:28,670
It's me.

53
00:04:30,870 --> 00:04:32,580
Other people's blood counts too.

54
00:04:32,580 --> 00:04:33,490
Shen Tianbai,

55
00:04:33,750 --> 00:04:35,110
I just saved you.

56
00:04:35,510 --> 00:04:36,750
If I hadn't guessed

57
00:04:36,750 --> 00:04:39,070
that this kind of house
might have a secret passage,

58
00:04:39,070 --> 00:04:40,070
you would have died out there.

59
00:04:40,070 --> 00:04:41,400
Let's go if you're fine.

60
00:04:51,590 --> 00:04:52,390
Shen Tianbai.

61
00:04:53,630 --> 00:04:54,430
Shen Tianbai.

62
00:04:57,150 --> 00:04:58,280
Something's wrong.

63
00:04:58,840 --> 00:05:01,970
We've been walking for so long
and haven't found an exit.

64
00:05:02,690 --> 00:05:05,690
And don't you think it's a bit cold here?

65
00:05:32,409 --> 00:05:33,610
I didn't find an exit.

66
00:05:34,350 --> 00:05:35,350
I only found this.

67
00:05:37,670 --> 00:05:38,710
What do we do now?

68
00:05:41,270 --> 00:05:43,790
We can only rest for now

69
00:05:44,310 --> 00:05:45,590
and calm down to think.

70
00:05:51,880 --> 00:05:54,159
Don't you think in such a cold place,

71
00:05:55,470 --> 00:05:56,800
we should sit together?

72
00:06:00,710 --> 00:06:01,630
Why?

73
00:06:02,590 --> 00:06:04,390
So it's easier for you to kill me?

74
00:06:04,750 --> 00:06:05,710
Are you still angry,

75
00:06:05,710 --> 00:06:06,510
Officer Shen?

76
00:06:07,670 --> 00:06:08,990
After all,

77
00:06:09,230 --> 00:06:11,690
we've been through life and death
together.

78
00:06:14,950 --> 00:06:15,950
You have a gun?

79
00:06:17,190 --> 00:06:18,190
Without bullets.

80
00:06:34,110 --> 00:06:35,630
Since we are in the house,

81
00:06:36,350 --> 00:06:37,590
there must be an exit.

82
00:06:38,070 --> 00:06:38,990
Not this way.

83
00:06:39,550 --> 00:06:40,680
Not that way either.

84
00:06:42,150 --> 00:06:43,470
Where is the exit?

85
00:06:45,909 --> 00:06:47,350
Where is the exit?

86
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:50,100
Stop.

87
00:06:50,270 --> 00:06:51,390
Don't draw anymore.

88
00:06:51,390 --> 00:06:53,390
You've drawn this path 3 times.

89
00:07:04,590 --> 00:07:05,270
Right.

90
00:07:06,190 --> 00:07:07,590
Where is your chocolate?

91
00:07:09,160 --> 00:07:10,160
Let me look for it.

92
00:07:16,630 --> 00:07:17,430
Here.

93
00:07:19,870 --> 00:07:21,270
Don't flatter yourself.

94
00:07:21,590 --> 00:07:22,590
Save your energy.

95
00:07:22,670 --> 00:07:23,470
Watch over me.

96
00:07:23,900 --> 00:07:24,860
Don't let me die.

97
00:08:11,710 --> 00:08:12,640
There is an exit.

98
00:08:13,390 --> 00:08:14,190
Lu Ye.

99
00:08:26,110 --> 00:08:27,240
The exit is too high.

100
00:08:27,710 --> 00:08:30,630
One of us has to stand
on the other's shoulders to get out.

101
00:08:30,630 --> 00:08:31,710
After getting out,

102
00:08:31,740 --> 00:08:33,600
he can come back to save the other.

103
00:08:36,190 --> 00:08:37,070
You go first.

104
00:08:39,070 --> 00:08:39,630
You...

105
00:08:41,059 --> 00:08:42,059
You saved my life.

106
00:08:42,350 --> 00:08:43,309
I owe you this.

107
00:08:48,030 --> 00:08:48,960
I will come back.

108
00:08:50,230 --> 00:08:51,110
Will you?

109
00:08:53,750 --> 00:08:54,550
I will.

110
00:08:55,790 --> 00:08:56,310
Okay.

111
00:08:56,310 --> 00:08:57,510
I'll help you get out.

112
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:16,320
You don't trust me?

113
00:09:16,410 --> 00:09:18,010
Of course, I don't trust you.

114
00:09:19,070 --> 00:09:21,030
Would you trust someone
who wants to kill you?

115
00:09:21,030 --> 00:09:23,470
I said I would come back, and I will!

116
00:09:23,820 --> 00:09:24,660
Come back?

117
00:09:25,170 --> 00:09:27,370
With the Shisha Gang to take my life?

118
00:09:28,390 --> 00:09:29,350
No matter what,

119
00:09:29,350 --> 00:09:30,630
I have to get out first.

120
00:09:31,100 --> 00:09:32,060
Lu Ye.

121
00:09:33,630 --> 00:09:36,110
You are the one who won't come back.

122
00:09:43,120 --> 00:09:44,180
Don't come closer!

123
00:09:44,400 --> 00:09:45,160
Lu Ye.

124
00:09:46,020 --> 00:09:47,300
You lied to me again.

125
00:09:47,910 --> 00:09:49,770
Is this your first day knowing me?

126
00:09:49,790 --> 00:09:50,790
Let me go first.

127
00:09:56,750 --> 00:09:57,630
Shoot.

128
00:09:58,390 --> 00:10:00,310
Shen Tianbai, are you crazy?

129
00:10:01,270 --> 00:10:03,130
Is this your first day knowing me?

130
00:10:04,380 --> 00:10:05,840
Do you really think
I wouldn't dare to shoot?

131
00:10:05,840 --> 00:10:07,000
You would.

132
00:10:07,110 --> 00:10:08,430
Of course, you would.

133
00:10:09,030 --> 00:10:10,270
If you kill me,

134
00:10:10,550 --> 00:10:12,390
you won't get out of here alive either.

135
00:10:12,390 --> 00:10:13,870
We'll die together.

136
00:10:14,830 --> 00:10:15,440
You...

137
00:10:19,230 --> 00:10:20,160
You have a fever?

138
00:10:20,700 --> 00:10:21,790
Why are your hands so hot?

139
00:10:21,790 --> 00:10:22,870
Shoot.

140
00:10:27,480 --> 00:10:28,540
I don't kill fools.

141
00:10:30,350 --> 00:10:31,150
I'm not a fool.

142
00:10:32,170 --> 00:10:32,970
Right,

143
00:10:33,470 --> 00:10:34,470
you're not a fool.

144
00:10:34,830 --> 00:10:36,310
That's why you should let me go first.

145
00:10:36,310 --> 00:10:37,260
Why?

146
00:10:37,430 --> 00:10:38,960
Because I remember the way.

147
00:10:39,830 --> 00:10:40,670
You know what?

148
00:10:40,670 --> 00:10:42,350
That map is already in my head.

149
00:10:43,190 --> 00:10:44,320
You won't come back.

150
00:10:44,830 --> 00:10:46,310
I've already sent a message
to Uncle Zhong.

151
00:10:46,310 --> 00:10:47,990
They won't pay attention to you if you go.

152
00:10:47,990 --> 00:10:49,240
You won't come back.

153
00:10:49,990 --> 00:10:51,110
And you're sick.

154
00:10:51,110 --> 00:10:51,590
You won't.

155
00:10:51,590 --> 00:10:53,190
If you go out, we'll both die.

156
00:10:53,230 --> 00:10:54,360
You won't come back.

157
00:10:55,070 --> 00:10:56,200
You won't come back.

158
00:10:56,710 --> 00:10:57,550
You won't.

159
00:10:57,580 --> 00:10:58,330
Geez.

160
00:10:58,420 --> 00:10:58,870
I will!

161
00:10:58,870 --> 00:11:00,020
I will come back!

162
00:11:02,550 --> 00:11:03,790
I don't believe you.

163
00:11:06,610 --> 00:11:07,740
I don't believe you.

164
00:11:07,920 --> 00:11:09,110
You have to believe me.

165
00:11:09,110 --> 00:11:10,240
I don't believe you.

166
00:11:10,960 --> 00:11:12,090
I don't believe you.

167
00:11:15,930 --> 00:11:17,630
Geez, it's damaged.

168
00:11:20,870 --> 00:11:21,670
Trust me.

169
00:11:22,670 --> 00:11:24,870
I'll be back before dawn.
